&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Justworks is building a connected go-to-market operating model across a multi-product platform with self-service, hybrid, partner, and managed-sales motions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Marketing Operations Manager — Funnel &amp;amp; Lifecycle will own the operational processes, data requirements, and business rules that help prospects and customers move through the right journey at the right time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner with Marketing, Sales, Partnerships, Product, and Customer Success to translate their strategies into effective intake, enrichment, scoring, routing, segmentation, nurture eligibility, and lifecycle triggers. You will use data and AI to help these teams make better decisions and identify where prospects and customers are getting stuck or overlooked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on individual-contributor role. You will work closely with Campaign Operations to turn journey requirements into coordinated execution, and with GTM Technology and Analytics to ensure the underlying systems and measurement support those journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map and improve prospect and customer journeys across products, channels, and self-service, hybrid, partner, and managed-sales paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own lead-management processes including intake, enrichment, qualification, scoring, routing, handoffs, recycling, and re-engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing and other GTM teams to define how customer needs, behaviors, and signals should inform the next action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate agreed strategies into audience definitions, eligibility criteria, scoring models, routing rules, lifecycle triggers, and suppression policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define operational requirements for nurture, abandoned applications, closed-lost re-engagement, onboarding, adoption, retention, and cross-sell programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Campaign Operations to implement, test, and monitor those journeys across execution platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear rules for ownership, response expectations, stage progression, contact frequency, exceptions, and handoffs between teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify funnel leakage, stalled journeys, conflicting outreach, and gaps in follow-up, then coordinate improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM Technology to address data quality, enrichment, integrations, and event or signal requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM Planning &amp;amp; Analysis to measure conversion, journey progression, routing accuracy, speed to lead, and handoff quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI and experimentation to improve prioritization, segmentation, decision-making, and exception detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain documentation, monitoring, and governance so journey rules remain reliable as the business evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in marketing operations, revenue operations, lifecycle operations, growth operations, or a related function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a multi-product B2B technology business with both self-service or product-led and sales-assisted motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of lead management, scoring, routing, segmentation, nurture, and lifecycle orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating business strategies into operational rules across CRM, marketing automation, and customer-engagement platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with firmographic, behavioral, product-usage, engagement, and customer data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical judgment and the ability to identify why prospects or customers are failing to progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of improving processes across teams and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional partnership skills and the ability to build agreement around shared decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI and automation to improve GTM operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospects and customers enter appropriate journeys and receive timely, relevant follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Routing, handoffs, nurture eligibility, and lifecycle rules are clear, accurate, and trusted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fewer prospects and customers are lost, stalled, misrouted, or exposed to conflicting outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing and GTM teams use shared journey definitions and have visibility into where improvements are needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Journey improvements contribute to stronger conversion, adoption, retention, and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $121,000.00 to $151,000.00 per year. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;This role is required to work a hybrid schedule including 2 days a week from our office at 55 Water Street, in New York City.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-BF1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
